OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers angry over funding
OL,4,Aapplication system
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers trying to get financial support
OL,7,Ffrom the government say they are being
OL,8,Ftreated "like a bunch of kids
OL,9,Fscrabbling on the floor for sweets"
OL,10,Fafter thousands missed out on the
OL,11,Flatest funding.
OL,13,FRose Barnecut, who has a mixed organic
OL,14,Ffarm in Cornwall, said the way the
OL,15,Fgovernment had handled post-Brexit
OL,16,Ffunding for farmers was "cruel" and
OL,17,Fwould push some out of business.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
