OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers angry over funding
OL,4,Aapplication system
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe described the latest episode of
OL,7,Fapplications for sustainable farming
OL,8,Fincentive (SFI) funding as a "fiasco"
OL,9,Fas farmers wrestled with online
OL,10,Fapplications and saw government cash
OL,11,Frun out after six hours.
OL,13,FThe government said it wanted to
OL,14,Fdevelop a "fairer system" and vowed to
OL,15,F"learn lessons" from this year's
OL,16,Fapplication process.
